    "description": "<p>You experience phantom limb &mdash; for a limb you&rsquo;ve never had. This missing part moves and feels, but you cannot see it. It finds some things/people/places pleasing, others repulsive. You feel it attempting to grasp, write, and manipulate. You see new limbs on other trippers, which they cannot sense. They describe limbs on you, which you neither sense nor feel. You can exchange limbs with each other to try them out, but they&rsquo;re usually not your missing limb. To find your ghost limb, you must explore it&rsquo;s invisible desires. The new limbs you try have minds of their own and may mislead you.</p>",
